Z||000004||btoth||09-03-2001||03:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B>Well, you connect speed and your transfer rate are two different things.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Good point.  I forgot to capitalize my B in my KBps.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Isn't there a physical limit to the transfer rate over an analog connection (like a dial-up modem)?  I remember reading about all of that when 56k was the new big thing.<P>||||reg||1
